    <string name="now_bar_footer">Uma umculo usesikhundleni se-Now Bar, umdlali omkhulu wesikrini sokukhiya uyafihlwa. Swayiphela ibha ukuze ushintshe phakathi kwemisebenzi, thepha ukuze uvule izilawuli, bese uyibamba isikhathi eside ukuze uyifihle kuze kuphele. Swayiphela ingoma emisiwe ukuze uyisuse ku-bar.\n\nAmaphuzu aphilayo akhombisa amageyimu amaqembu alandelayo ku-app ye-Google. Uma usebenzisa i-Smartspacer, engeza ukuhlola kwezemidlalo lapho, bese amaphuzu awo eza lapha.</string>
